{#
  BeMart admin Member list — EC-CUBE goMemberList (メンバー管理).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Setting/System/member.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Setting/System/member.twig).

  Setting/System section, DATA/LIST page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin `default_frame.twig`),
  not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*`
  / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound to the MemberList resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/MemberList.php — body carries `count` +
  `members`, a list of {adminId, loginId, name, authority, work}).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `{% for Member in Members %}` -> the resource body's `members` list.
     EC-CUBE keys the per-row action `<a>`s by `Member.id` (dtb_member
     primary key); the MemberListFetched projection does not surface the
     numeric id, only `loginId`, so BeMart keys the row + actions by
     `loginId`. Same anchors, same classes — only the id param differs.
   - `Member.department` -> NOT carried by the MemberListFetched
     projection (EC-CUBE's dtb_member.department was out of the Wave 8
     admin-grid slice). The 所属 column cell renders empty, not invented.
     FLAGGED missing-body-field — enumerated as residual.
   - `Member.Authority.name` -> the projection carries `authority` only
     as a bare int (mtb_authority id), with no joined master-data label.
     The 権限 column cell renders empty. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - `Member.Work.name` -> the projection carries `work` only as a bare
     int (mtb_work id). The 稼働 column cell renders empty. FLAGGED.
   - `Member.two_factor_auth_enabled` / `two_factor_auth_key` -> NOT
     carried by the projection (2FA columns were out of the Wave 8
     slice). The 2段階認証 column cell renders empty. FLAGGED.
   - `Member.id == app.user.id` (self-row delete guard) -> BeMart's html
     context has no operator entity, so the self-target branch is never
     taken; every row renders the normal delete affordance.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the delete `<a>` -> EC-CUBE per-request
     CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront ports omit it.
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - The `<form name="form1">` wrapper carries no `_token` (the list page
     posts nothing); kept verbatim.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_setting_system_member' %}
{% set title = 'メンバー管理' %}
{% set sub_title = 'システム設定' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        $('.action-down, .action-up').on('click', function(e) {
            var self = $(this),
                current = $(this).parents('tr');
            $('body').append($('<div class="modal-backdrop show"></div>'));
            $.ajax({
                url: self.attr('href'),
                method: self.data('method'),
            }).done(function() {
                if (self.hasClass('action-down')) {
                    current.next().after(current);
                } else {
                    current.prev().before(current);
                }
            }).always(function() {
                $('.modal-backdrop').remove();
                $('.action-up, .action-down').removeClass('disabled');
                $('.action-up').first().addClass('disabled');
                $('.action-down').last().addClass('disabled');
            });

            return false;
        });
    </script>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div id="ex-member-new" class="d-block mb-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_member_new') }}">新規登録</a>
                </div>
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                        <form name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="">
                            <table class="table table-sm">
                                <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-center">
                                        名前
                                    </th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-center">
                                        所属
                                    </th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-center">
                                        権限
                                    </th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-center">
                                        稼働
                                    </th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-center">
                                        2段階認証
                                    </th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-center"></th>
                                </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                {% for Member in members %}
                                    <tr id="ex-member-{{ Member.loginId }}">
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center ps-3">
                                            {{ Member.name }}
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle pe-3">
                                            <div class="text-end">
                                                <div class="px-1 d-inline-block">
                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon action-edit"
                                                       href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_member_edit', { 'id' : Member.loginId }) }}"
                                                       data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                                                       data-bs-placement="top"
                                                       title="編集">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-pencil fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="px-1 d-inline-block">
                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon action-up {% if loop.first %} disabled {% endif %}"
                                                       href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_member_up', {id: Member.loginId}) }}"
                                                       data-bs-toggle="tooltip"

                                                       data-bs-placement="top"
                                                       title="上へ">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-arrow-up fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="px-1 d-inline-block">
                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon action-down {% if loop.last %} disabled {% endif %}"
                                                       href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_member_down', {id: Member.loginId}) }}"
                                                       data-bs-toggle="tooltip"

                                                       data-bs-placement="top"
                                                       title="下へ">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-arrow-down fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="px-1 d-inline-block">
                                                    <div class="d-inline-block me-2" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                                         title="削除">
                                                        <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon action-delete"
                                                           data-bs-toggle="modal"
                                                           data-bs-target="#member_delete_{{ Member.loginId }}">
                                                            <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                        </a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="modal fade" id="member_delete_{{ Member.loginId }}" tabindex="-1"
                                                         role="dialog"
                                                         aria-labelledby="member_delete_{{ Member.loginId }}" aria-hidden="true">
                                                        <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                                            <div class="modal-content">
                                                                <div class="modal-header">
                                                                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                                                                        メンバーを削除します。</h5>
                                                                    <button class="btn-close" type="button"
                                                                            data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                                                                            aria-label="Close">
                                                                    </button>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                                                    <p class="text-start">
                                                                        メンバーを削除してよろしいですか？</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="modal-footer">
                                                                    <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">キャンセル
                                                                    </button>
                                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-delete"
                                                                       href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_member_delete', {id: Member.loginId}) }}"
                                                                       data-confirm="false">
                                                                        削除
                                                                    </a>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
